  "units": [
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68d3e831000000001303691b:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-json-desc-7:u1",
      "position": 1,
      "source_unit_type": "narrative-summary",
      "text_projection": "一个没人要的后端开发，HR捞到客户端岗位。",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_json/68d3e831000000001303691b.json@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "335ac95bd8f5f38075f9e3a2ee83d4bb8a65e3ac71312390b4fd4530df75b588",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/68d3e831000000001303691b.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "28c40ee360ac83ce45965df89cba41a8152962cf5f95af9c1982650d8f690742",
        "source_projection_item_number": 1
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68d3e831000000001303691b:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-json-desc-7:u2",
      "position": 2,
      "source_unit_type": "question-like",
      "text_projection": "一面也聊不了什么东西，就着八股问几句，就着项目吹水，还让我混过去了，岗位jd说什么“接受零经验”。手撕滑窗和bfs，一眼的事[叹气R]，面试官还是太温柔了。。",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_json/68d3e831000000001303691b.json@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "335ac95bd8f5f38075f9e3a2ee83d4bb8a65e3ac71312390b4fd4530df75b588",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/68d3e831000000001303691b.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "28c40ee360ac83ce45965df89cba41a8152962cf5f95af9c1982650d8f690742",
        "source_projection_item_number": 2
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68d3e831000000001303691b:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-json-desc-7:u3",
      "position": 3,
      "source_unit_type": "question-like",
      "text_projection": "隔天吃饭时候约二面，二面上来就是“你知道自己投的客户端吗？”瞎扯几句，手撕反转链表和接雨水，净耽误功夫了。",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_json/68d3e831000000001303691b.json@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "335ac95bd8f5f38075f9e3a2ee83d4bb8a65e3ac71312390b4fd4530df75b588",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/68d3e831000000001303691b.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "28c40ee360ac83ce45965df89cba41a8152962cf5f95af9c1982650d8f690742",
        "source_projection_item_number": 3
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68d3e831000000001303691b:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-json-desc-7:u4",
      "position": 4,
      "source_unit_type": "outcome-reflection-summary",
      "text_projection": "秋招结束了。。。奇怪，晚上七点的面试都过了，下午五点的面试全挂了。[失望R]",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_json/68d3e831000000001303691b.json@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "335ac95bd8f5f38075f9e3a2ee83d4bb8a65e3ac71312390b4fd4530df75b588",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/68d3e831000000001303691b.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "28c40ee360ac83ce45965df89cba41a8152962cf5f95af9c1982650d8f690742",
        "source_projection_item_number": 4
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68d3e831000000001303691b:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-json-desc-7:u5",
      "position": 5,
      "source_unit_type": "narrative-summary",
      "text_projection": "二编：",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_json/68d3e831000000001303691b.json@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "335ac95bd8f5f38075f9e3a2ee83d4bb8a65e3ac71312390b4fd4530df75b588",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/68d3e831000000001303691b.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "28c40ee360ac83ce45965df89cba41a8152962cf5f95af9c1982650d8f690742",
        "source_projection_item_number": 5
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68d3e831000000001303691b:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-json-desc-7:u6",
      "position": 6,
      "source_unit_type": "outcome-reflection-summary",
      "text_projection": "其实好好想想，以前端客户端进去大厂，压力会小很多。面试面着面着就有种疲了的感觉，还是我太菜了，可能面试官也不想多说什么，也没难为什么。可惜最后跟二面面试官解释代码的时候没什么精力了，没把自己想法说清楚，其实想说前后缀分解，双指针优化，考虑水平扩展可以用单调栈，但是最后嘟嘟囔囔，啥也没说出来。该挂！[叹气R]",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_json/68d3e831000000001303691b.json@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "335ac95bd8f5f38075f9e3a2ee83d4bb8a65e3ac71312390b4fd4530df75b588",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/68d3e831000000001303691b.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "28c40ee360ac83ce45965df89cba41a8152962cf5f95af9c1982650d8f690742",
        "source_projection_item_number": 6
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68d3e831000000001303691b:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-json-desc-7:u7",
      "position": 7,
      "source_unit_type": "outcome-reflection-summary",
      "text_projection": "没来个笔试，直接进面试有点猝不及防，HR直接加微信约一面，然后我还推迟了一次，二面也不太好意思了，结果搞得乱七八糟。秋招还是泰难！面试比笔试难多了，面试比笔试累多了！想笔试（应该没有三机位吧，设备不够的），不想面试！",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_json/68d3e831000000001303691b.json@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
